Lucky Lode — attribution and licensing
======================================

Lucky Lode is a fair-launch, hybrid PoW/PoS mineable coin. This repository
contains the Rust reference crates, the wallet, and the design documents;
the consensus node is a fork of VerusCoin maintained in its own
repository, [LuckyLode-node](https://github.com/kdsmith18542/LuckyLode-node)
(see that repository's NOTICE and COPYING).

